==Chalk==
{{Lore Entry
|image=ON-icon-style material-Fine Chalk.png
|imgdesc=Fine chalk
|description=[[Lore:Chalk|Chalk]] is a soft white porous rock, that has a variety of uses, such a form of writing or drawing implement. It can also be dyed a variety of colors.{{ref|name=ChalkSet|[[ON:Treasures C#Chalk Stick Set|Chalk Stick Set]] item description in [[ON:Online|ESO]]}} Unscrupulous alchemists or bakers may adulterate their goods by adding ground chalk as a filler.{{ref|name=TWFAM|{{Cite Book|The Wedding Feast: A Memoir}}}}{{ref|name=ThaniaESO|[[ON:Thania Facian|Thania Facian]] dialogue in [[ON:Gold Road|ESO: Gold Road]]}} Chalk also has uses in certain magical rituals such as when preparing a ritual space.{{ref|name=DreadhornShaman|[[ON:Dreadhorn Shaman|Dreadhorn Shaman]] item description in [[ON:Horns of the Reach|ESO: Horns of the Reach]]}}{{ref|name=PN|{{Cite Book|Practical Necromancy}}}}

Some cosmetics make use of chalk, for example the [[Lore:Bright-Throat Tribe|Bright-Throat]]s were known to have used chalk as dye for their tribe's body paint.{{ref|name=AppearanceESO|[[ON:Chalk and Coal Scale Skull|Chalk and Coal Scale Skull]], [[ON:Chalk and Coal Skull|Chalk and Coal Skull]], [[ON:Chalky White Lips|Chalky White Lips]] face markings in [[ON:Online|ESO]]}}{{ref|name=BrightThroatChalk|[[ON:Bright-Throat Chalk Body Tattoo|Bright-Throat Chalk Body]] and [[ON:Bright-Throat Chalk Face Tattoo|Face Tattoo]]s item descriptions in [[ON:Online|ESO]]}} Chalk can also be used a powder foundation for facial cosmetics, such as with the [[Lore:Khajiit|Khajiit]] in [[Lore:Pellitine|Pellitine]].{{ref|name=SnoutPowder|[[ON:Treasures P#Pellitine Snout-Powder|Pellitine Snout-Powder]] item description in [[ON:Online|ESO]]}} In the [[Lore:Second Era|Second Era]], some [[Lore:Thieves Guild|Thieves Guild]]s used fine chalk when crafting their armor and weapons.{{ref|nameFineChalk|[[Online:Thieves Guild Style|Thieves Guild Style]] and the styling material [[ON:Fine Chalk|Fine Chalk]] used in [[ON:Online|ESO]]}}
|place=*[[Online:Fine Chalk|ESO]]
}}

