==Clay==
{{Lore Entry
|image=SR-item-Clay Deposit.jpg
|imgdesc=A clay deposit
|description='''Clay''' is a mud-like substance commonly used in pottery, porcelain,{{ref|[[Online:Contraband/Drinkware#Porcelain Teapot|Porcelain Teapot]] in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}} and bricks.{{ref|[[Online:Mobar Mine|Mobar Mine]] [[Online:Loading Screens|loading screen]] in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}} It is sometimes used for skincare and to preserve [[Lore:Mudcrab|mudcrabs]].{{ref|[[Online:Contraband/Grooming Items#Crock of Packing Mud|Crock of Packing Mud]] in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}} The [[Lore:Orsimer|Orsimer]] are known to use it in their paints.{{ref|{{Cite Book|The Red Paint}}}} It is also sometimes used for chips for use in games.{{ref|{{Cite Book|Legends of the Forest}}}} In ancient times, the [[Lore:Argonians|Argonians]] used clay for tablets used to inscribe [[Lore:Jel|Jel]] pictograms.{{ref|[[Online:Unzoned Quest Items#Xal-Toh Tablet|Xal-Toh Tablet]] in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}}
|place=*[[Skyrim:Clay|Skyrim]], [[Castles:Clay|Castles]]
}}

==Coal==
{{Lore Entry
|image=ON-furnishing-Dark Elf Bed of Coals.jpg
|imgdesc=Bed of coals
|description=Coal is brownish-black rock that is primarily used as fuel.{{ref|Events of [[Online:A Sticky Solution|A Sticky Solution]] in [[Online:Online|ESO]]: ''[[Online:Clockwork City (DLC)|Clockwork City]]''}} It is also used as a component in black body paint.{{ref|[[Online:Painted Coal and Embers|Painted Coal and Embers]] body markings in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}} Anthracite is a variety of coal.{{ref|name=OI|[[ON:Onyx Indrik|Onyx Indrik]]'s default name in [[Online:Online|ESO]]}} Coals are used in a [[Lore:Reachfolk|Reachfolk]] ritual of ember dance.{{Ref|name=Caddach|[[ON:Ard Caddach|Ard Caddach]]'s dialogue in [[Online:Online|ESO]]&#58; ''[[Online:Markarth (DLC)|Markarth]]''}} [[Lore:Cinder-Heart Clan|Cinder-Heart Clan]] uses them in their version of [[Lore:Briarheart|Briarheart]] ritual.{{Ref|name=OCR|{{Cite Book|On the Clans of the Reach}}}}
|place=*[[Online:Dark Elf Furnishings|ESO]]
}}

