==Morpholith==
{{Lore Entry
|image=ON-pet-Unstable Morpholith.jpg
|imgdesc=An unstable morpholith
|description= A '''morpholith''' is a type of mineral. Common morpholiths such as [[Lore:Soul Gems|soul gems]] can be found within nature.{{Ref|name=LB|{{Cite Book|Liminal Bridges}}}}

Quasi-crystalline morpholiths are involved in the creation of [[Lore:Sigil Stone|sigil stones]]. These exotic morpholiths occur only in [[Lore:Planes of Existence|pocket voids]] of [[Lore:Oblivion|Oblivion]] and cannot be mined or harvested without Daedric assistance.{{Ref|name=LB}} Daedra are theorized to use enchanted chisels to excavate such exotic morpholiths.{{ref|{{Item Link|Ancient Morpholith Chisel|quality=4|itemid=181642}} [[Online:The Deadlands Antiquities|Antiquities Codex]] in [[ESO:Online|ESO]]}} Some morpholiths harvested in this manner are inherently unstable and therefore unsuitable for use as sigil stones.{{ref|[[ON:Unstable Morpholith|Unstable Morpholith]] pet in [[ESO:Online|ESO]]}} Although unstable morpholiths cannot be used to open portals, they do have other uses in various summoning rituals.{{ref|[[ON:Unstable Morpholith|Unstable Morpholith]] fragment upgrades in [[ESO:Online|ESO]]}}
|place=*[[Online:Unstable Morpholith|ESO]]
}}

